      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## How to Use this Workflow\n\n1. Change the \"TargetDirectoryConfig\" Node to the directory on your machine you want your Todoist note to sync down to.\n2. Add your Todoist API Key to the \"Todoist\" Node\n3. Add your target discord bot to your \"Discord\" channel.\n4. [Optional] - Change how often you want to execute this node in the \"Daily at Midnight\" Node.\n\n### Setting up Todoist in N8N\n[N8N Todoist Docs](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.todoist/) has the information on setting up the Todoist node in N8N\n\n### Setting up Discord in N8N\nThe [N8N Discord Docs](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.discord/) has the information on setting up the Discord Node\n",
